## 📊 Complexity Analysis

* **Time Complexity:** $\mathcal{O}(n)$ per test case. Both the `left` and `right` pointers traverse the array exactly once. Hash map (dictionary) operations take $\mathcal{O}(1)$ time on average.
* **Space Complexity:** $\mathcal{O}(k)$ to store the frequency dictionary containing at most $k + 1$ distinct elements at any given moment.
